    content: "---\nname: wayfinder\ndescription: Map unfamiliar repos in <60s (entry points, build, hot paths, verified commands) without bloating 100K context.\nwhen_not_to_use: Repos already mapped in the current session or targeted single-file edits.\nverified: \"2026-11\"\nassets: [scripts/repo-map.sh]\ntriggers: [map repo, unfamiliar codebase, directory tree, entry points, 60s recon]\n---\n# Wayfinder (v6 · 100K-Safe Repo Recon)\n\n> **Lazy-load:** Run `scripts/repo-map.sh` only when a full tree snapshot helps; delegate large unfamiliar repos to an `explore` subagent to protect main `100K` context.\n\n## Must-do\n1. **Tree & Manifests First:** Run `find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/.*' -not -path './node_modules*' -not -path './dist*' -not -path './.svelte-kit*' -not -path './build*' -not -path './target*'` and read root manifests (`package.json`, `build.gradle*`, `Cargo.toml`, `AGENTS.md`, `.github/workflows/*`).\n2. **Entry Points & Hot Paths:** Locate entries (`src/main.ts`, `App.svelte`, `MainActivity.kt`, `main.rs`, `bin/*`) via `rg --files`; trace core data flow with bounded reads (`sed -n '1,120p'`).\n3. **Output Compact Repo Map (4 bullets):** `Stack & Build`, `Entry Points & Core Modules` (exact paths), `External/IO Contracts` (APIs/DB/JNI/ports), and `Verified Commands` (read directly from repo scripts/workflows).\n\n## Invariants\n- **NEVER** dump lockfiles (`pnpm-lock.yaml`, `package-lock.json`, `Cargo.lock`), `dist/`, or `build/` artifacts into context.\n- **NEVER** guess file paths or build scripts not verified in manifests or `rg --files`.\n",
